From 13fec7f96e968f8f801373c6b37c63bd604f331b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HybridGt <hybridgt@localhost>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:49:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 05/14] Game: opt-in switch for the title's stall watchdog
 (VICTORY_NO_STALL_WATCHDOG) (HybridGt)

1.0.2.1 ends itself at +0x23cf683 (write to 0) when its heartbeat stalls
~30 s or a GPU timestamp is too old (+0x2215c70 je, +0x2215bdc jae, both
verified in the mapped image). Run11 (RTX 4070 Ti, GPU_UPLOAD shadows)
ended there during loading - the stop ivall/xcl#878 reports. The two
branches become NOPs only on exact bytes. Hides real hangs: a tool to
reach the world while the runtime is slow, not a fix. 6 unit tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
